#. 全員が記憶喪失なんて…
msgctxt "0001 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"You're saying we\n"
"all got spontaneous amnesia?"
msgstr ""

#. これは、いつから
#. ＳＦになったんだべ！
msgctxt "0002 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Since when did this turn into\n"
"some kind of sci-fi fantasy!?"
msgstr ""

#. 私は記憶喪失
#. なんかじゃないよ！
msgctxt "0003 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I promise you\n"
"I haven't lost my memory!"
msgstr ""

#. だって、この学園に
#. 来てから起きた事だって…
msgctxt "0004 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Ever since\n"
"I got to this school..."
msgstr ""

#. ちゃんと
#. <CLT 9>全部覚えてる<CLT>もん！
msgctxt "0005 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"...<CLT 9>I remember everything<CLT> \n"
"that's happened!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…
#. 記憶喪失っていうのは…
msgctxt "0006 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"So the i-idea\n"
"that we all lost our m-memories..."
msgstr ""

#. ある訳ねーべ！
#. 当たり前だろ！！
msgctxt "0007 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "...is totally stupid! Obviously!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>バカバカしい…<CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>This is ridiculous...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>俺が記憶を失っているだと？<CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>You think we all lost our memories?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>わわわたしだって…<CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>E-E-E-Even me...?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>本当にそうかしら？<CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>Is it really possible?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>むしろ忘れられねーぞ！<CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>There's no way I forgot anything!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>ねえねえ、オマエラ…<CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>Hey, guys!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>ボクを議論に混ぜなさい！<CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>I wanna be part of the debate, too!<CLT>"
msgstr ""
